{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 18, :comments ["<b>For it is double the wage of a hireling.</b> From here the Sages said: a Hebrew slave works both by day and by night, and this is the doubling relative to the labor of day-laborers. And what is his labor at night? His master gives him a Canaanite maidservant, and the offspring belong to the master (Sifrei)."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 15, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:47:13.372844614Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}